# Phase 18 consumer-offset header API — 2026-10-18 18:07 UTC

- Branch: `phase/18-phase-18-compatibility-closure`.
- Pinned Java 5.5.1 inventories record public methods and constructors for
  `QueryConsumerOffsetRequestHeader`, `UpdateConsumerOffsetRequestHeader`, and
  `QueryConsumerOffsetResponseHeader`; each has no public fields. Rust fields
  are now crate-private with Java-equivalent accessors. Query/update request
  `Display` matches Java `toString()` output.
- `UpdateConsumerOffsetRequestHeader` now retains inherited `lo` in encode and
  decode. Invoked Java fixtures cover API inventories, request text, field
  visibility and the inherited value. Fixture SHA-256:
  `2a62dd6f4171bd043a21c9f9fbf3f79299a07723d165540a1589d5d7312abab1`.
- Code commit: `b71406fa fix(protocol): align consumer offset header APIs`.

